<td id="A3.T8.4.1.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right">cosine   <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:0.5pt;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span></td>
<td id="A3.T8.4.1.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right">cosine   <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:0.5pt;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span></td>
